{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14107301","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107301","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730001:":{"text":"さあ飲むがよい。これは地上の湧き水だ……","source_cn":"喝下吧，这地表清澈的泉水……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86B20E0CF131DED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730002:":{"text":"うがああぁっ！の、喉がっ、喉があぁ……っ！","source_cn":"啊啊啊！我的喉咙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79B6FA28D5430595","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730003:":{"text":"体がっ！体の中がっ……！","source_cn":"不！我的内脏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x414CF43E4887E349","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730202:":{"text":"ぐっ……がああぁ！","source_cn":"啊……啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA642BEC7E7DB34E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410730201:":{"text":"ああ、女王陛下のお恵みに感謝！！","source_cn":"女王……感谢您的恩典！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C984067D0E4DB0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410730101:0":{"text":"見たか。これがミサタの呪いだ。","source_cn":"看到了吗？这就是弥萨忒的诅咒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA3FCC9717B377FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410730102:0":{"text":"地上の清らかな水、この世で最もありふれた恵みが、我らの厄化を呼び起こす……なんとも皮肉ではないか？","source_cn":"多么讽刺啊……地表的清水，这世间最普通的恩赐，却是我族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D6F4FA7643FF4F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410730103:0":{"text":"まずは激痛、そして気が触れ……最後は理性を失った異形のものと化す。","source_cn":"一开始是剧痛，随后是疯狂，最后……沦为失去理智的怪物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E7E014FC6163AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410730104:0":{"text":"二千年前、我は勇敢なヴェルディアの戦士たちを連れて、故郷を後にしたが……生きてサロクディアの地に辿り着いた者は一割にも満たなかった……","source_cn":"两千年前，我带领着最骁勇的绿裔战士们离开故土，可最终…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C0816C9596D90C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410730105:0":{"text":"だが、運命は我らを竜の元へ導いてくれた。正しくは、眠りについている原初の竜だが……","source_cn":"命运此时却再度眷顾了我们，我找到了龙，准确地说，是沉睡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6EC876BA876FAD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410730106:0":{"text":"あやつが眠っている理由は分からぬが、このまま永遠に目覚めぬ方がありがたい。","source_cn":"我不知道它为何在此沉睡，但我希望它永远不要醒来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49B80FB2DA55ED88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410730107:0":{"text":"神の力に対抗しうる原初の竜さえいれば、我らがミサタの呪いに苛まれることもない。","source_cn":"因为龙之力足以与神明相抗，利用初始之龙，艾塞勒将再也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB55799ECD22DD0A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410730108:0":{"text":"だが、竜の力はあまりにも強く、我は本体ではなく、卵に含まれる魔法と生命力の制御を試みた。","source_cn":"但初始之龙的力量太过强大，难以驾驭。我不得不退而求其次...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278D98AB7DE2B656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410730109:0":{"text":"そして幾千もの失敗を重ね、ついに恵の霊水が完成したのだ。","source_cn":"经过千百次的失败，我成功了。恩典灵露，终于诞生了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29C416A16CA7535D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410730110:0":{"text":"ふっ、我が己の功績を誇示しているように聞こえるか？否――","source_cn":"你们以为我在夸耀自己的功绩吗？不——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC37EFACE0C6B671B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410730111:0":{"text":"恵の霊水は、我自らが生み出した救済。神の力ではなく、この我が……","source_cn":"恩典灵露是我亲手酿造的救赎。不靠神明，而是我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCCDD4B834494392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410730112:0":{"text":"エクシルに新たな命をもたらしたのだ！","source_cn":"赐予了艾塞勒一族的新生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA9B8777F9A80A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410730113:0":{"text":"さあ、我の恩恵をその目にしかと焼き付けよ。","source_cn":"此刻，就让你们亲眼见证恩典的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBEF9A385096FFE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410730114:0":{"text":"その者に霊水を、片方はそのまま――","source_cn":"给这一位灵露。而另一位，就让他向诸位展示——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AC97E5039DCA184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410730115:0":{"text":"恩恵に見放された者の末路を見せてやるがよい。","source_cn":"被恩典抛弃的下场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C658B1E1C482477","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:21:1410730001:":{"text":"さあ飲むがよい。これは地上の湧き水だ……","source_cn":"喝下吧，这地表清澈的泉水……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86B20E0CF131DED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","varia